WEBVTT

00:16.340 --> 00:19.950
<b>Your eyes that look far off
into the distance</b>

00:19.950 --> 00:23.620
<b>They're listening to the voice
within your heart</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.580
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:34.500
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.500 --> 00:38.170
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.170 --> 00:42.130
<b>Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon</b>

00:45.470 --> 00:52.710
<b>Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you</b>

00:52.710 --> 00:59.990
<b>It's in such a moment that this world
will begin to stir</b>

00:59.990 --> 01:03.660
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.660 --> 01:07.260
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.260 --> 01:14.540
<b>We'll meet here again someday,
if that's the truth</b>

01:14.540 --> 01:18.170
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.170 --> 01:24.910
<b>The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.910 --> 01:28.680
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:35.490 --> 01:37.360
<b>Are we camping out here for real?</b>

01:38.760 --> 01:41.420
<b>We should be able to stay out
of the rain at least.</b>

01:42.700 --> 01:44.570
<b>Come on, pull that tight.</b>

01:44.570 --> 01:46.030
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

01:49.500 --> 01:50.970
<b>Damn...</b>

01:51.640 --> 01:53.900
<b>Sanzo gets in a bad mood
when it rains.</b>

01:55.110 --> 01:58.240
<b>I think Hakkai told me why once,
but I've forgotten.</b>

01:59.180 --> 02:01.740
<b>Well, it's got nothing to do
with me anyway.</b>

02:02.720 --> 02:04.410
<b>I don't hate rain that much.</b>

02:05.390 --> 02:09.480
<b>I was always wandering in the
pouring rain, covered in mud.</b>

02:10.630 --> 02:13.260
<b>Holding on tight to a past that
would never go away,</b>

02:13.260 --> 02:16.630
<b>I'd wish the rain would
wash everything away.</b>

02:16.630 --> 02:18.100
<b>That's how I used to think.</b>

02:19.030 --> 02:21.540
<b>And well, now that I've
given myself airs,</b>

02:21.540 --> 02:24.770
<b>I should mention I'm not the only
one with scars from the past.</b>

02:24.770 --> 02:26.980
<b>The connection between us
can't be severed,</b>

02:26.980 --> 02:28.410
<b>not even if we tried.</b>

02:30.180 --> 02:32.810
<b>Come to think of it, that day
three years ago,</b>

02:32.810 --> 02:35.250
<b>there was cold rain like this too.</b>

02:50.600 --> 02:52.070
<b>Aces, four of a kind.</b>

02:53.840 --> 02:54.870
<b>Oh, my God!</b>

02:54.870 --> 02:56.370
<b>That's amazing!</b>

02:56.370 --> 02:58.640
<b>Hey, come on, give me
a break already, Gojyo.</b>

02:59.210 --> 03:02.210
<b>It's too early to start
complaining, Tongpu.</b>

03:02.210 --> 03:04.580
<b>The night's still young.</b>

03:04.580 --> 03:05.710
<b>That's right.</b>

03:05.710 --> 03:07.520
<b>Things are just getting started.</b>

03:07.520 --> 03:10.850
<b>All right, if I win this hand,
it's my treat tonight.</b>

03:12.120 --> 03:13.820
<b>Gojyo, good luck!</b>

03:13.820 --> 03:16.690
<b>What the heck? Are all the women
on Gojyo's side?</b>

03:17.490 --> 03:19.130
<b>Of course.</b>

03:19.130 --> 03:20.230
<b>Damn...</b>

03:20.230 --> 03:23.600
<b>But you know, Gojyo, your hair
is really pretty.</b>

03:23.600 --> 03:25.460
<b>How do you dye it?</b>

03:26.430 --> 03:29.740
<b>Now that I look closer, your eyes
are a wine-red too.</b>

03:29.740 --> 03:32.000
<b>I think I'm done for the day after all.</b>

03:33.240 --> 03:35.310
<b>Bartender, put the drinks on my tab.</b>

03:35.310 --> 03:36.810
<b>Wait, Gojyo!</b>

03:36.810 --> 03:38.350
<b>See you later.</b>

03:38.350 --> 03:43.850
<b>Dummy, Gojyo gets moody as soon
as someone mentions his hair.</b>

03:43.850 --> 03:45.750
<b>What?! Why?!</b>

03:45.750 --> 03:47.220
<b>Who knows?</b>

03:49.820 --> 03:53.500
<b>I can pay for my board if I just
win some boring bets,</b>

03:53.500 --> 03:57.830
<b>and I can get through the nights by
seducing women with cheap words.</b>

03:57.830 --> 04:01.200
<b>Living is disgustingly easy.</b>

04:04.010 --> 04:06.270
<b>I just have to not look anyone
in the eyes.</b>

04:07.340 --> 04:10.110
<b>Pretty hair? I don't know about that.</b>

04:11.610 --> 04:13.080
<b>To me, it rather looks...</b>

04:26.700 --> 04:28.160
<b>What's up with this guy?</b>

04:31.730 --> 04:34.100
<b>Hey? You dead?</b>

04:35.470 --> 04:38.230
<b>Oh, hey, you're alive!</b>

04:46.410 --> 04:47.880
<b>He...</b>

04:50.820 --> 04:52.290
<b>...looked at me.</b>

04:53.220 --> 04:54.650
<b>And I thought he laughed at me.</b>

04:58.730 --> 05:00.660
<b>Mass murder?</b>

05:01.330 --> 05:05.230
<b>That's right, about two months ago,
the Dark Crow Clan.</b>

05:05.230 --> 05:08.500
<b>In addition, just the other day,
Hyakugan Maoh's Clan.</b>

05:08.500 --> 05:11.270
<b>All together, roughly one thousand
have been slaughtered.</b>

05:13.070 --> 05:14.700
<b>One thousand, you say?</b>

05:16.180 --> 05:18.180
<b>Genjo Sanzo...</b>

05:18.180 --> 05:19.410
<b>My Lady!</b>

05:19.410 --> 05:23.280
<b>We'd like you to track down this
atrocious criminal.</b>

05:24.520 --> 05:27.720
<b>His name is Cho Gonou, a youth
who used to be human.</b>

05:29.260 --> 05:30.720
<b>Cho Gonou...</b>

05:45.640 --> 05:47.440
<b>Hell looks rather...</b>

05:48.240 --> 05:50.370
<b>...commonplace.</b>

05:51.950 --> 05:54.110
<b>Well, excuse me for it being
so commonplace.</b>

05:55.450 --> 05:58.010
<b>You sure took your sweet time
waking up.</b>

05:59.120 --> 06:02.420
<b>Sheesh, the doctor said
you had to get total rest</b>

06:02.420 --> 06:05.050
<b>and told me not to smoke near you.</b>

06:05.660 --> 06:09.000
<b>But I'm gonna smoke now!
You better let me!</b>

06:09.000 --> 06:11.520
<b>Oh, yes, go ahead.</b>

06:13.940 --> 06:15.400
<b>Aw, forget it.</b>

06:17.770 --> 06:23.010
<b>Were you the one who saved me?</b>

06:24.480 --> 06:26.210
<b>Too bad for you.</b>

06:27.280 --> 06:29.150
<b>That this isn't Hell.</b>

06:31.650 --> 06:33.090
<b>Do you wish you were dead?</b>

06:39.460 --> 06:43.020
<b>No, I think it's good it
turned out this way.</b>

06:44.230 --> 06:45.860
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

06:46.900 --> 06:50.140
<b>I pretty much treated most
of your wounds</b>

06:50.140 --> 06:52.200
<b>while you were comatose
for about a week.</b>

06:53.880 --> 06:56.580
<b>I just sort of stuffed your innards
that were sticking out back in,</b>

06:56.580 --> 06:58.050
<b>but you should be okay.</b>

06:59.050 --> 07:00.510
<b>I see...</b>

07:01.680 --> 07:05.050
<b>I'm out of beans. Sorry it's instant.</b>

07:06.050 --> 07:07.490
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:07.490 --> 07:09.820
<b>I had a doctor take
a look at you too.</b>

07:09.820 --> 07:12.190
<b>He said you should be able to get up
and around in about a month.</b>

07:13.090 --> 07:15.190
<b>So, stay in bed for now.
Don't move around.</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:21.200
<b>And this is the first and last time
I'll carry a guy to bed, got it?</b>

07:22.500 --> 07:23.970
<b>Yes...</b>

07:26.470 --> 07:27.580
<b>It's Master Sanzo!</b>

07:27.580 --> 07:29.200
<b>Master Sanzo has returned.</b>

07:30.250 --> 07:32.210
<b>What's all the commotion?</b>

07:32.210 --> 07:33.980
<b>Well, that is...</b>

07:34.550 --> 07:36.020
<b>Oh, Sanzo!</b>

07:37.090 --> 07:38.520
<b>Welcome back!</b>

07:39.420 --> 07:43.220
<b>He brought a dog covered with dirt
into the compound.</b>

07:43.220 --> 07:46.680
<b>They're uncontrollable, soiling
and breaking altar articles.</b>

07:51.370 --> 07:53.170
<b>Sanzo, look.</b>

07:53.170 --> 07:54.640
<b>You damn...</b>

07:55.270 --> 07:56.770
<b>...stupid monkey.</b>

07:56.770 --> 08:00.010
<b>That hurt! What'd you do
that for, Sanzo?!</b>

08:00.010 --> 08:00.240
<b>Don't ask me what for!
Has your brain melted?!</b>

08:00.240 --> 08:02.280
<b>It's so troublesome with these things
happening all the time.
Don't ask me what for!
Has your brain melted?!</b>

08:02.280 --> 08:03.510
<b>It's so troublesome with these things
happening all the time.
Get washed and changed, now!</b>

08:03.510 --> 08:06.150
<b>Why did Master Sanzo pick up
such a lowly child anyway?
Get washed and changed, now!</b>

08:06.150 --> 08:08.750
<b>Why did Master Sanzo pick up
such a lowly child anyway?
I know that!</b>

08:08.750 --> 08:10.480
<b>I couldn't agree more.</b>

08:12.420 --> 08:13.890
<b>Please pardon us!</b>

08:16.690 --> 08:18.390
<b>Why did I pick him up?</b>

08:19.130 --> 08:20.720
<b>That's what I want to know.</b>

08:21.700 --> 08:24.430
<b>It was just noisy.</b>

08:26.270 --> 08:30.270
<b>His voice continually calling for me
grated on my nerves,</b>

08:30.270 --> 08:32.430
<b>so I thought I'd go smack him once.</b>

08:34.080 --> 08:38.550
<b>But he looked up at me with such
a stupid look on his face,</b>

08:38.550 --> 08:40.210
<b>I lost my will to smack him.</b>

08:43.450 --> 08:45.750
<b>Sanzo, are you going somewhere?</b>

08:45.750 --> 08:48.020
<b>Yeah, I've been assigned
the bothersome mission</b>

08:48.020 --> 08:49.820
<b>of tracking someone down.</b>

08:49.820 --> 08:51.590
<b>I'll be gone for a while.</b>

08:51.590 --> 08:53.690
<b>Then take me with you!</b>

08:54.460 --> 08:58.530
<b>I refuse. Why should I go walking
around with an animal?</b>

08:58.530 --> 09:00.240
<b>Who're you calling an animal?!</b>

09:00.240 --> 09:02.000
<b>Aren't you aware of what you are?</b>

09:02.000 --> 09:03.770
<b>You've got it bad, monkey.</b>

09:03.770 --> 09:06.500
<b>I don't wanna be left behind!</b>

09:09.110 --> 09:11.440
<b>Why did Master Sanzo
pick up such a...</b>

09:11.980 --> 09:13.450
<b>Come on, Sanzo!</b>

09:16.780 --> 09:20.120
<b>You really are just unbearably noisy.</b>

09:22.790 --> 09:24.950
<b>What's wrong, Goku? You want
to be left behind?</b>

09:29.160 --> 09:30.650
<b>Wait up, Sanzo!</b>

09:32.530 --> 09:34.070
<b>Full house...</b>

09:34.070 --> 09:36.070
<b>Not bad at all.</b>

09:36.070 --> 09:38.500
<b>And here I was going easy on you
because you're an invalid.</b>

09:39.070 --> 09:40.680
<b>Even though I wasn't.</b>

09:40.680 --> 09:42.140
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

09:43.040 --> 09:45.070
<b>You never ask anything about me.</b>

09:46.450 --> 09:47.940
<b>I'm not really interested.</b>

09:49.080 --> 09:50.720
<b>Since I've already troubled
you so much,</b>

09:50.720 --> 09:53.620
<b>would it be all right if I stay until
I can get around on my own?</b>

09:54.990 --> 09:56.460
<b>You got anywhere to go?</b>

09:57.590 --> 10:01.360
<b>No, but I do have one piece
of unfinished business.</b>

10:02.830 --> 10:05.500
<b>How about that?! I've got
a full house this time!</b>

10:05.500 --> 10:08.160
<b>Oh, I'm sorry, I have a straight flush.</b>

10:09.340 --> 10:13.780
<b>Hey, I make a living off this,
you know. What are you, a pro?</b>

10:13.780 --> 10:17.370
<b>Well, I've just always been good
at these sorts of things.</b>

10:19.550 --> 10:22.650
<b>But even if I can read
the flow of a game,</b>

10:22.650 --> 10:26.850
<b>it's useless unless I actually
have luck on my side.</b>

10:27.620 --> 10:30.420
<b>You're that clever poor guy type,
aren't you?</b>

10:31.290 --> 10:32.760
<b>It seems that way.</b>

10:33.330 --> 10:34.800
<b>I am too.</b>

10:46.870 --> 10:48.360
<b>Hey, Sanzo.</b>

10:49.110 --> 10:52.210
<b>Since this Cho Gonou guy
killed lots of demons</b>

10:52.210 --> 10:54.120
<b>and turned into a demon himself,</b>

10:54.120 --> 10:55.780
<b>that means he's a real bad guy, right?</b>

10:56.520 --> 10:57.980
<b>Who knows?</b>

10:58.650 --> 11:01.490
<b>I have no other clues except
for his physical description.</b>

11:01.490 --> 11:03.860
<b>And I've got questions about
the mission itself.</b>

11:04.790 --> 11:06.530
<b>Why did the Sanbutsushin</b>

11:06.530 --> 11:09.090
<b>send me to pursue just an
ordinary demon murderer?</b>

11:09.900 --> 11:11.360
<b>Or is there more to this?</b>

11:12.270 --> 11:15.170
<b>Say, don't you think Gojyo's
been kind of cold lately?</b>

11:15.170 --> 11:18.540
<b>Yeah, he went straight home
yesterday too.</b>

11:18.540 --> 11:21.540
<b>Remember a month ago, he said
he took in some wounded guy?</b>

11:21.540 --> 11:23.380
<b>That's when it started.</b>

11:23.380 --> 11:27.010
<b>The doctor said it's a guy with
green eyes and a pretty face.</b>

11:29.620 --> 11:31.150
<b>Sanzo?</b>

11:31.150 --> 11:35.360
<b>Hey, tell me more about that guy.</b>

11:35.360 --> 11:37.890
<b>You're kind of good-looking
for a monk.</b>

11:37.890 --> 11:39.760
<b>You interested in guys?</b>

11:39.760 --> 11:43.390
<b>I don't mind telling you,
but in exchange...</b>

11:45.700 --> 11:48.400
<b>In exchange for what, scum-sucker?</b>

11:49.940 --> 11:52.870
<b>Mr. Gojyo, might I have
a moment of your time?</b>

11:52.870 --> 11:55.340
<b>Sure, are you leaving?</b>

11:55.340 --> 11:56.910
<b>Yes!</b>

11:56.910 --> 11:59.780
<b>But before I do, there's something
I'd like to tell you.</b>

12:00.680 --> 12:03.250
<b>I've killed many</b>

12:03.250 --> 12:06.150
<b>with the blade of my ego,
in the name of revenge.</b>

12:07.520 --> 12:09.660
<b>When I've finished what I left undone,</b>

12:09.660 --> 12:12.020
<b>I'll accept whatever punishment
or reparations I must make.</b>

12:12.930 --> 12:15.730
<b>I'm truly grateful to you for saving me.</b>

12:20.000 --> 12:22.340
<b>Perhaps this is my penitence.</b>

12:22.340 --> 12:23.840
<b>Penitence?</b>

12:23.840 --> 12:26.710
<b>Your hair and your eyes...</b>

12:27.980 --> 12:29.470
<b>...remind me of blood.</b>

12:34.980 --> 12:40.520
<b>The crimson that stains my hands
has kept me grounded in reality,</b>

12:40.520 --> 12:44.180
<b>even as I tried to escape
the weight of my sins.</b>

12:45.460 --> 12:50.630
<b>Your hair and your eyes
admonish me, Mr. Gojyo.</b>

12:54.440 --> 12:55.670
<b>I see.</b>

12:55.670 --> 12:57.530
<b>Well, I'll be going now.</b>

12:58.170 --> 12:59.640
<b>Sure...</b>

13:00.940 --> 13:03.810
<b>Maybe what I wanted was
to meet someone</b>

13:03.810 --> 13:07.470
<b>who could only see blood in this
crimson color, just like me.</b>

13:08.750 --> 13:10.220
<b>Say...</b>

13:11.620 --> 13:13.640
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

13:14.860 --> 13:16.320
<b>I am...</b>

13:17.530 --> 13:18.990
<b>Oh, hang on a sec.</b>

13:21.100 --> 13:22.560
<b>Yeah, yeah, who is it?</b>

13:24.870 --> 13:26.400
<b>I'm sorry to disturb you at night,</b>

13:26.400 --> 13:27.870
<b>but I'm looking for someone.</b>

13:28.640 --> 13:32.410
<b>He's a diabolical criminal, on the run
after committing mass murder.</b>

13:32.410 --> 13:35.340
<b>He's a young man in his twenties
with green eyes.</b>

13:36.740 --> 13:39.180
<b>His name is Cho Gonou.</b>

13:39.850 --> 13:42.910
<b>Really? Never heard of him.</b>

13:43.820 --> 13:48.620
<b>Don't play dumb. I heard in town
that you took this man in.</b>

13:48.620 --> 13:51.260
<b>And I'm telling you I've
never heard of him.</b>

13:51.260 --> 13:53.190
<b>Who the hell are you anyway?</b>

13:53.190 --> 13:55.460
<b>What's a monk doing looking
for a murderer?</b>

14:01.070 --> 14:02.240
<b>Let go.</b>

14:02.240 --> 14:03.700
<b>What if I say no?</b>

14:09.480 --> 14:10.910
<b>Bastard!</b>

14:17.550 --> 14:19.750
<b>I'll kill you, you sorry bastard!</b>

14:21.520 --> 14:23.620
<b>You're no ordinary monk, are you?</b>

14:24.230 --> 14:26.920
<b>Don't think you can take me.
Now get out of my way!</b>

14:27.630 --> 14:30.860
<b>You might be pretty, but you're
a man, so no can do.</b>

14:31.630 --> 14:33.660
<b>You want to die that badly?</b>

14:34.770 --> 14:36.240
<b>You just try it.</b>

14:40.580 --> 14:42.300
<b>Damn quasi-monk!</b>

14:42.910 --> 14:46.780
<b>Next time, that stuffy head of yours
is gonna get ventilated!</b>

14:47.580 --> 14:49.350
<b>Mr. Gojyo!</b>

14:49.350 --> 14:51.290
<b>Stay inside!</b>

14:51.290 --> 14:52.720
<b>Cho Gonou?!</b>

14:52.720 --> 14:54.190
<b>Damn it!</b>

15:00.130 --> 15:01.830
<b>You bastard...</b>

15:01.830 --> 15:03.890
<b>I'm best when I'm on top!</b>

15:04.900 --> 15:06.370
<b>Hurry up and run!</b>

15:07.500 --> 15:08.970
<b>Never mind, just go!</b>

15:10.570 --> 15:12.040
<b>Goku!</b>

15:12.940 --> 15:15.370
<b>Damn, you have a friend with you?</b>

15:17.680 --> 15:20.110
<b>I just have to beat this guy,
right, Sanzo?</b>

15:23.320 --> 15:24.780
<b>Damn...</b>

15:30.890 --> 15:35.690
<b>He just barely managed it, but
he blocked Goku's attack!</b>

15:38.500 --> 15:42.370
<b>Sanzo, this guy might actually be
pretty strong!</b>

15:42.370 --> 15:43.930
<b>Don't sound so happy!</b>

15:44.910 --> 15:46.530
<b>Then I'll take it seriously from here!</b>

15:53.610 --> 15:55.550
<b>What the hell is up with that brat?!</b>

15:55.550 --> 15:57.020
<b>He's fast!</b>

16:02.360 --> 16:03.660
<b>No fair.</b>

16:03.660 --> 16:04.660
<b>Goku!</b>

16:04.660 --> 16:06.820
<b>Please don't move. Just listen to me.</b>

16:08.100 --> 16:10.030
<b>He has nothing to do with me.</b>

16:10.830 --> 16:13.670
<b>Please don't blame him for any of this.</b>

16:13.670 --> 16:17.670
<b>It's true I've committed horrible sins.</b>

16:17.670 --> 16:21.440
<b>But there's just one thing I must do.</b>

16:22.640 --> 16:24.580
<b>Time...</b>

16:24.580 --> 16:26.440
<b>Please, give me just a little time.</b>

16:28.880 --> 16:30.910
<b>I'm sorry for having done this.</b>

16:33.420 --> 16:34.890
<b>Hey!</b>

16:36.190 --> 16:37.660
<b>In all honesty,</b>

16:39.830 --> 16:42.390
<b>I've desired to be condemned to Hell,</b>

16:43.260 --> 16:46.300
<b>ever since I lost what
was precious to me.</b>

16:46.300 --> 16:47.840
<b>This?</b>

16:47.840 --> 16:51.400
<b>To me, she was my love and she
was also like an older sister.</b>

16:52.040 --> 16:53.900
<b>She always gently
embraced everything.</b>

16:55.080 --> 16:57.100
<b>I made a promise to her.</b>

16:58.310 --> 17:01.080
<b>That I'd protect her, no matter
what happened.</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:03.850
<b>That I'd always be with her
and not go anywhere.</b>

17:03.850 --> 17:08.690
<b>But... You know how people often
talk about premonitions?</b>

17:08.690 --> 17:13.130
<b>Well, when she was in danger,
I was oblivious.</b>

17:13.130 --> 17:16.430
<b>I sensed nothing. I was carefree,
playing with my students.</b>

17:17.770 --> 17:21.170
<b>Why wasn't I able to come
to some realization then</b>

17:21.170 --> 17:24.000
<b>and go running home to her?</b>

17:25.110 --> 17:27.630
<b>Isn't that pretty much what life's like?</b>

17:28.680 --> 17:32.010
<b>That doesn't mean you didn't
love her enough.</b>

17:32.010 --> 17:34.240
<b>It's no reason for you
to blame yourself.</b>

17:35.550 --> 17:38.310
<b>Well, I'm not in any position
to say though.</b>

17:39.490 --> 17:42.820
<b>I don't have anything precious,
so I wouldn't really know.</b>

17:46.460 --> 17:50.290
<b>I know what I said, but what
the heck is love anyway?</b>

17:51.270 --> 17:53.530
<b>Not like I want it or anything.</b>

17:55.370 --> 17:58.740
<b>I let my hair grow out as
a lesson to myself,</b>

17:58.740 --> 18:02.710
<b>and it hid the scars I got when
my mother almost killed me.</b>

18:02.710 --> 18:04.910
<b>The color of blood that's
like an admonishment...</b>

18:04.910 --> 18:08.280
<b>I thought I was the only one
who saw it that way.</b>

18:08.280 --> 18:12.690
<b>The love I couldn't win, the love
he couldn't protect.</b>

18:12.690 --> 18:14.990
<b>He and I both blame ourselves
for being so powerless</b>

18:14.990 --> 18:18.720
<b>as we watch the phantoms who
vanished in a sea of blood.</b>

18:20.800 --> 18:23.130
<b>His name's Cho Gonou?</b>

18:23.130 --> 18:25.100
<b>It doesn't fit him.</b>

18:25.100 --> 18:27.700
<b>You really never heard
anything from him?</b>

18:27.700 --> 18:30.730
<b>Haven't I been telling you
that all along?</b>

18:31.440 --> 18:32.910
<b>More importantly...</b>

18:34.180 --> 18:37.510
<b>Why do I gotta feed your pet?!</b>

18:38.480 --> 18:41.510
<b>Hey, this is good! Can I finish it?</b>

18:42.720 --> 18:45.650
<b>You trying to eat all the food
I've got, you monkey?!</b>

18:45.650 --> 18:48.920
<b>I'm not a monkey! I'm Goku!
Son Goku!</b>

18:48.920 --> 18:52.130
<b>Shuddup! Stupid monkey is more
than good enough for you!</b>

18:52.130 --> 18:55.800
<b>Well, he apparently went without food
or drink for five hundred years.</b>

18:55.800 --> 18:58.230
<b>His body's probably trying
to make up for it.</b>

18:58.230 --> 18:59.730
<b>What? What's that about?</b>

18:59.730 --> 19:02.200
<b>But you certainly are eccentric.</b>

19:02.200 --> 19:05.600
<b>Why'd you take him in when you knew
it'd cause misunderstandings?</b>

19:06.870 --> 19:09.600
<b>I wonder why? I don't
really know either.</b>

19:10.210 --> 19:13.510
<b>Hey, Sanzo, is he really a bad guy?</b>

19:14.110 --> 19:15.420
<b>What're you getting at?</b>

19:15.420 --> 19:18.450
<b>Because he just didn't seem like it.</b>

19:19.620 --> 19:22.360
<b>Murder isn't necessarily
equal to evil, right?</b>

19:22.360 --> 19:23.860
<b>With the world the way it is,</b>

19:23.860 --> 19:26.420
<b>there are plenty who more
than deserve to be killed.</b>

19:27.060 --> 19:30.160
<b>But those who kill others and live on</b>

19:30.160 --> 19:33.830
<b>must, at the same time, be prepared
to be killed themselves.</b>

19:33.830 --> 19:36.390
<b>That's the law of consequences.</b>

19:37.240 --> 19:39.970
<b>That's why, in this world,
whether they be good or bad,</b>

19:39.970 --> 19:43.670
<b>the ones who'll be standing in the end
are those with a strong will to live.</b>

19:45.580 --> 19:47.640
<b>Will to live?</b>

19:50.650 --> 19:53.290
<b>It's too bad you're a monk.</b>

19:53.290 --> 19:55.520
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

19:55.520 --> 19:58.930
<b>But what're we going to do, Sanzo?</b>

19:58.930 --> 20:00.660
<b>You gonna just let him go?</b>

20:00.660 --> 20:04.600
<b>No, it's a pain in the butt,
but it's still my mission.</b>

20:04.600 --> 20:06.800
<b>So I can't just let him be.</b>

20:06.800 --> 20:09.330
<b>I think you'll just be wasting your time.</b>

20:11.070 --> 20:13.810
<b>I don't know what he left undone,</b>

20:13.810 --> 20:15.430
<b>but when he's finished...</b>

20:17.040 --> 20:18.780
<b>He'll probably die.</b>

20:18.780 --> 20:20.440
<b>That's the kind of guy he is.</b>

20:21.320 --> 20:25.310
<b>If that's true, there's even more
reason for me to go after him.</b>

20:27.420 --> 20:29.790
<b>I was ordered to capture Cho Gonou</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:32.630
<b>and bring him to the Palace
of the Setting Sun.</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:34.720
<b>I can't have him dying at
his own convenience!</b>

20:35.930 --> 20:37.830
<b>Sorry to bother you.</b>

20:37.830 --> 20:39.300
<b>Hey...</b>

20:40.530 --> 20:42.000
<b>Take me with you.</b>

20:43.440 --> 20:49.880
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:49.880 --> 20:55.250
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:55.250 --> 21:00.720
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

21:00.720 --> 21:04.120
<b>And look up</b>

21:04.120 --> 21:09.930
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:09.930 --> 21:15.370
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:15.370 --> 21:20.670
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:20.670 --> 21:24.610
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:31.620 --> 21:35.290
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.290 --> 21:37.220
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.220 --> 21:41.360
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.360 --> 21:45.500
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:45.500 --> 21:48.170
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.170 --> 21:53.210
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:53.210 --> 21:58.610
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:58.610 --> 22:04.050
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:04.050 --> 22:08.110
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
